<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Intending good, but failing still,</l><l>I slaved for sin against my will.</l><l>But Christ redeemed, enlivened me,</l><l>Replaced my bonds with liberty!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I wandered far and found no home;</l><l>If not my feet, my heart did roam.</l><l>But I have found my family—</l><l>Christ and the church—a place for me!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
